<title>SRI LANKA: Three Acre 3-month net sharply up.</title>
<headline>Three Acre 3-month net sharply up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Three Acre Farms Ltd for the three months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			1997	     1996</p>
<p>    Turnover     128.50   vs     45.64</p>
<p>    Net profit     2.72   vs	1.07</p>
<p>    Tax		1.25   vs	0.20</p>
<p>NOTE - Three Acre Farms Ltd is a subsidiary of Ceylon Grain Elevators Ltd. The company grows day-old chicks for the domestic market.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
